ale from zero point one to ten. Squares and error bars represent estimated hazard ratios and confidence intervals for each variable comparison, with reference to better or worse progression-free survival.)/K 1/P 580 0 R/Pg 29 0 R/S/Figure/T()>>endobj586 0 obj<</BBox 587 0 R/Height 211.124/O/Layout/Width 340.101>>endobj587 0 obj[127.162 137.083 467.263 348.208]endobj588 0 obj<</BBox 589 0 R/Height 120.416/O/Layout/Width 340.101>>endobj589 0 obj[127.162 638.249 467.263 758.664]endobj590 0 obj<</Author(Pan Cheng)/CreationDate(D:20260518093953+08'00')/Keywords(disitamab vedotin; efficacy; gastric cancer; human epidermal growth factor 2; real-world research)/ModDate(D:20260518093953+08'00')/Subject(Cheng P, Ge J, Huang S, Yang D, Xie S, Wang B, Bai Z, He J and Liu X \(2026\) Efficacy and safety of disitamab vedotin in treatment of advanced gastric cancer based on real-world. Front. Oncol. 16:1807824. doi: 10.3389/fonc.2026.1807824)/Title(Efficacy and safety of disitamab vedotin in treatment of advanced gastric cancer based on real-world)>>endobjxref
